    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense i guess, but it's still making me a little nervous. it feels weird to just hand over a huge sum of money to some random person or company i don't even know personally. how do i know they won't just... i don't know, start hoarding it or lose it in some messy system? is there like any way to see where the money is actually kept to make sure it's not just sitting in some random pile or something?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
